<title>FRANCE: EU grain exports ending season near 27 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>EU grain exports ending season near 27 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>With one week's data left before the end of the European Union crop year, grain exports are poised to end the July/June season near 27 million tonnes, EU figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Exports and imports were again little changed in the week to June 24, with most exports frozen by the European Commission and imports nudging slightly higher.</p>
</text>
